```suggestion
  } else if (XLEN == 32) {
    # [1:0] must read-as-zero for XLEN 32
    return ($bits(CSR[ssp]) & ~3);
  }
  return ($bits(CSR[ssp]) & ~7);
```
I think this structure makes it more obvious that we're always returning _something_.

